flowchart LR
  subgraph IN[输入]
    G[计算图 G]
    HW[硬件配置]
    SC[问题场景 P1 / P2 / P3]
  end

  PRE[图特征预计算]

  subgraph SEED[Seed阶段]
    BASE[Baseline<br/>seed阶段起始候选]
    FAM[多粒度候选生成<br/>balanced · affinity · critical · pipe<br/>grains 4/12/32；fine-grain=2候选变体]
    ASSIGN[HEFT-style核分配]
    SEVAL[Seed候选逐个调用官方Evaluator]
    INC[严格目标比较<br/>当前best-so-far]
  end

  subgraph VNS[VNS邻域搜索]
    POOL[候选池<br/>最多48个合法唯一候选]
    RANK[启发式排序]
    TOP[Top-K<br/>最多3个]
    VEVAL[官方Evaluator]
    DESC{是否严格改善？}
    ADAPT[更新邻域统计<br/>adaptive选择/停止]
  end

  OUT[各场景分别得到最终调度方案]
  E1[P1官方评价结果]
  E2[P2官方评价结果]
  E3[P3官方评价结果]

  G --> PRE
  HW --> PRE
  SC --> PRE
  PRE --> BASE
  PRE --> FAM
  BASE --> ASSIGN
  FAM --> ASSIGN
  ASSIGN --> SEVAL --> INC
  INC --> POOL
  POOL --> RANK --> TOP --> VEVAL --> DESC
  DESC -- 是：更新incumbent --> ADAPT
  DESC -- 否：保持当前解 --> ADAPT
  ADAPT -- 继续 --> POOL
  ADAPT -- 停止 --> OUT
  OUT --> E1
  OUT --> E2
  OUT --> E3
